with friends or jumping into public lobbies, every round is unpredictable and intense.\n\n\ud83d\udd25 FEATURES\n\n\ud83c\udf4e Fast-paced multiplayer tag gameplay\n\n\ud83e\udd7d Built from the ground up for VR movement\n\n\ud83c\udfc3 Smooth climbing, jumping, and locomotion\n\n\ud83c\udfae Easy to learn, high skill ceiling\n\n\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83e\udd1d\u200d\ud83e\uddd1 Play with friends or public lobbies\n\n\ud83c\udfa8 Bright, fun environments optimized for VR\n\n\ud83d\ude80 Regular updates and new content planned\n\nIf you love movement-based VR games and nonstop action, Apple Taggers VR delivers pure adrenaline and fun.", "short_description": "Apple Taggers VR is a fast-paced multiplayer tag game where speed, skill, and movement decide who wins. Climb, jump, and chase your friends in colorful maps \u2014 but don\u2019t get tagged!"}]}, "developer_name": "Pulser Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/appletaggers/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Zuse", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/appletaggers/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "26422675897350563"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823893_894683056640491_7075